# Copy to `static/.env` (or pass inline to `npm run build`).
#
# Your Xano instance origin — no path, no trailing slash. The client appends the API
# group canonical itself (`/api:auth`, `/api:nerve`).
VITE_XANO_API_BASE=https://x8ki-letl-twmt.n7.xano.io

# NOTE: every VITE_* variable is inlined into the world-readable bundle. The only
# credential this app ever holds is the signed-in user's own auth token, kept in
# localStorage. Never put an ingest API key, an Anthropic key, or any other secret here —
# device ingest keys belong to devices, and the Anthropic key belongs in Xano's workspace
# environment variables where the function stack reads it server-side.
